<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
  .header-logo { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .form-section { margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .field-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .field-label { font-weight: bold; width: 30%; }
  .field-value { width: 65%; }
  .checkbox-group { display: flex; gap: 20px; margin-top: 10px; }
  .checkbox-item label { font-weight: normal; }
  .signature-line { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 50px; width: 40%; }
  textarea { width: 100%; height: 100px; border: 1px solid #000; padding: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="University Logo" style="height: 80px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">MONMOUTH UNIVERSITY</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Doctor of Occupational Therapy Program</h2>
    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 0;">Observation Form</h3>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>Monmouth University's Doctor of Occupational Therapy program requires 40 hours of observation in a minimum of two practice environments and across two different populations that must be completed prior to admission to the program. Examples of settings and populations are listed below. This form will need to be completed and signed by the Occupational Therapist or Occupational Therapy Assistant at each site observed.</p>
    <p>This form must be uploaded to your application and submitted by the application deadline in order for your application to be considered complete. Please use the OT Pre-Req Completion form for hours planned but not completed.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt;">Observation of Occupational Therapy Practice</h3>

    <div class="field-row">
      <div class="field-label">Name of Applicant:</div>
      <div class="field-value"><span data-field="applicant.full_name">{{ applicant.full_name }}</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="field-row">
      <div class="field-label">Name of Facility:</div>
      <div class="field-value"><span data-field="facility.name">{{ facility.name }}</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="field-row">
      <div class="field-label">Total Number of Hours at this facility:</div>
      <div class="field-value"><span data-field="hours_at_facility">{{ hours_at_facility }}</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="field-row">
      <div class="field-label">Type of Facility:</div>
      <div class="field-value">
        <div class="checkbox-group">
          <div class="checkbox-item"><input type="checkbox" id="inpatient"><label for="inpatient">Inpatient- Hospital</label></div>
          <div class="checkbox-item"><input type="checkbox" id="outpatient"><label for="outpatient">Out-patient Center</label></div>
          <div class="checkbox-item"><input type="checkbox" id="hospital"><label for="hospital">Outpatient-Hospital</label></div>
          <div class="checkbox-item"><input type="checkbox" id="school"><label for="school">School-based Practice</label></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="field-row">
      <div class="field-label">OT Practice Environment(s):</div>
      <div class="field-value">
        <div class="checkbox-group">
          <div class="checkbox-item"><input type="checkbox" id="private"><label for="private">Private community-based practice</label></div>
          <div class="checkbox-item"><input type="checkbox" id="mental"><label for="mental">Mental Health setting</label></div>
          <div class="checkbox-item"><input type="checkbox" id="home"><label for="home">Home Health</label></div>
          <div class="checkbox-item"><input type="checkbox" id="assisted"><label for="assisted">Assisted Living</label></div>
          <div class="checkbox-item"><input type="checkbox" id="early"><label for="early">Early Intervention</label></div>
          <div class="checkbox-item"><input type="checkbox" id="skilled"><label for="skilled">Skilled Nursing</label></div>
          <div class="checkbox-item"><input type="checkbox" id="hospice"><label for="hospice">Hospice</label></div>
          <div class="checkbox-item"><input type="checkbox" id="other"><label for="other">Other</label></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="field-row">
      <div class="field-label">Stage of Lifespan (majority of clients observed):</div>
      <div class="field-value">
        <div class="checkbox-group">
          <div class="checkbox-item"><input type="checkbox" id="pediatric"><label for="pediatric">Pediatric (0-18)</label></div>
          <div class="checkbox-item"><input type="checkbox" id="adult"><label for="adult">Adult (18-64)</label></div>
          <div class="checkbox-item"><input type="checkbox" id="older"><label for="older">Older Adult (65+)</label></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="field-row">
      <div class="field-label">Address of Facility:</div>
      <div class="field-value" style="width: 100%; border-bottom: 1px solid #000;">
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 20px;">
          <div style="width: 33%;"></div>
          <div style="width: 33%;"></div>
          <div style="width: 33%;"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt;">Occupational Therapist/Occupational Therapist Assistant Comments:</h3>
    <textarea data-field="ot_comments">{{ ot_comments }}</textarea>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section" style="margin-top: 80px;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div style="width: 30%;">
        Printed Name of OT/OTA:
        <div class="signature-line" data-field="field_1">{{ field_1 }}</div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">
        Date:
        <div class="signature-line" data-field="printed_name_of_ot_ota">{{ printed_name_of_ot_ota }}</div>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">
        Signature of OT/OTA:
        <div class="signature-line" data-field="date">{{ date }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>